  "details": "Animation parameters, that can be set for specific friend groups only, such as the \"IsOnFriendsList\" but rather, \"IsIn*FavName*\" where FavName is the name of the friends favourites category, so that avatars could be setup to have certain toggles only work for people in those specific friend groups, such an an NSFW category, or a Roleplay category.\n\nThis would allow for vastly reducing the amount of visible NSFW in public worlds, as they would need to create the favourites category, and friend/add everyone in the public lobby to it so that they could see it.\n\nThis concept could be expanded to VRC Groups, with certain toggles only applying to people in certain groups, or with certain group roles, which would allow for dynamically adjusting your avatar to specific roleplay scenarios or theming your avatar based on the groups you are in.",
